module change-validation-benavides.reading

import change-validation.splits.{ NoticeReceived, reopen-window }
import core.frap26.{ frap26 }

/// Reading A: "We hold that the seven-day filing period of Rule 4(a)(6)
/// was not triggered when an attorney not involved in this case told
/// Benavides in February 1993 of the order"; it opens on written notice
/// received "from the clerk or any party" (79 F.3d at 1215). The
/// reading is of the 1991 text, so it runs over that text's window.
/// (The vendored opinion has no section heading to bind, so the cite is a
/// hole.)
deadline benavides-reading: 7.days after NoticeReceived(Written, ClerkOrParty) counted_by frap26 effective [1991-12-01, 2005-12-01) interprets reopen-window cite ?("Benavides v. Bureau of Prisons, 79 F.3d 1211, 1215 (D.C. Cir. 1996)")
{
  forum frap
}
